From 0ac764212f128c3fc190630fd6ab7e0641ca1715 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gaius Mulley <gaiusmod2@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PR modula2/127622: spell checking candidates should include
 base module and types

This patch ensures that the base module is pushed first and that the
scope check code does not stop at a module boundary.  The patch also
allows symbols to be filtered on variables, types and constants.

gcc/m2/ChangeLog:

	PR modula2/127622
	* gm2-compiler/M2Base.mod (CheckCompatible): Rename t1 to left.
	Rename t2 to right.
	Add spellcheck hint format specifiers to unknown types.
	* gm2-compiler/M2MetaError.mod (ConfigureFilter): New procedure.
	(errorBlock): filterVar new field.
	filterType new field.
	filterConst new field.
	(continuation): Add T V C filter modifiers.
	(FilterOnType): New procedure.
	(FilterOnVariable): Ditto.
	(FilrerOnConst): Ditto.
	(SpellHint): Call ConfigureFilter.
	* gm2-compiler/M2StackSpell.def (FilterType): New procedure.
	(FilterVariable): Ditto.
	(FilrerConst): Ditto.
	* gm2-compiler/M2StackSpell.mod (FilterKind): New type.
	(FilterSet): Ditto.
	(CurrentFilter): New variable.
	(PushNameFilter): New procedure.
	(PushCandidates): Pass PushNameFilter as callback.
	(GetSpellHintFilter): New procedure.
	(GetSpellHint): Reimplement.
	(FilterType): New procedure.
	(FilterVariable): Ditto.
	(FilterConst): Ditto.
	(Init): Initialize CurrentFilter.
	* gm2-compiler/P3SymBuild.mod (P3StartBuildDefModule): Push base
	module.
	(P3EndBuildDefModule): Pop base module.
	(P3StartBuildImpModule): Push base module.
	(P3EndBuildImpModule): Pop base module.
	(P3StartBuildProgModule): Push base module.
	(P3EndBuildProgModule): Pop base module.
	(StartBuildInnerModule): Push base module.
	(EndBuildInnerModule): Pop base module.
	* gm2-compiler/PCSymBuild.mod (PCEndBuildDefModule): Pop
	base module.
	(PCStartBuildImpModule): Push base module.
	(PCEndBuildImpModule): Pop base module.
	(PCStartBuildProgModule): Push base module.
	(PCEndBuildProgModule): Pop base module.
	(StartBuildInnerModule): Push base module.
	(EndBuildInnerModule): Pop base module.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	PR modula2/127622
	* gm2.dg/spell/iso/fail/badspelltype.mod: New test.
	* gm2.dg/spell/iso/fail/badspelltype2.mod: New test.

(cherry picked from commit 074937c853850cef4281931b6709f95098a486c9)

Signed-off-by: Gaius Mulley <gaiusmod2@gmail.com>
